# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary> [CQ-<number>]
#
# types:  feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scopes: server unity engine shared scripts docs ci repo
# Example: feat(server): add health endpoint with remaining budget [CQ-7]
#
# Body (optional): explain what and why, wrap at 72 chars.
#
# Footer (optional):
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
#   CQ-7 #comment <text>      (Jira smart commit)
#   CQ-7 #done                (Jira smart commit transition)
